Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: rsnd: don't use private_value on rsnd_kctrl_new()
To: Mark Brown <broonie@kernel.org>
CC: Linux-ALSA <alsa-devel@alsa-project.org>,
        Simon <horms@verge.net.au>, <linux-renesas-soc@vger.kernel.org>
